      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n#TOMS品牌商品來報報<br />\n⭐TOM'S 手指彈力遊戲機<br />\n-<br />\n藍色、黑色共兩色💙🖤<br />\n可愛小型手指版拳擊台！<br />\n可切換無/有音樂模式🔕<br />\n不想太吵雜也可以安靜遊玩！<br />\n適合與親子同樂朋友聚會PK遊玩🤼🤼🤼<br />\n看看誰材質最厲害的拳(手)擊(指)手！<br />\n-<br />\n▪ 材質：塑膠 (ＰＰ)、電子零件<br />\n▪ 尺寸：10.6×14.9×18.9 cm±5%<br />\n小編分數最多５００左右💥同事打到９９９!!!<br />\n✨預計１０月中可至各現場尋寶看看哦！✨<br />\n-<br />\n✨彩票資訊：<br />\n📍 一般會員｜彩票數 2150 張 <br />\n📍 VIP 會員 ｜彩票數 1720 張<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-ams2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854194253_1555400806608190_2019427815694731742_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=109&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=Gp0k_B6nyOEQ7kNvwF2a9ql&amp;_nc_oc=AdrlbtPlv6FN-OGg9FS1wEKaYZnKinz4wXe_z5THaqrJFdEEhkCAmIZFqvp-VhbBDtM&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=L73ksMJTJIBxGQf6Zyi6kA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQI7rSGFq8o2a5cgZLKvupcVMj_7_g3u5zBsZGQk7dFIAequpJxzHsHpW02a0P8MrA0svJtL1l3m&amp;oh=00_AQNOyUlWrBMaxsVDN1YIPm9K8gDTA2Bt_I26lOoEkP8hcA&amp;oe=6ADF9DA3\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-ams2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/852275098_1555400836608187_8841894877258848294_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=105&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=RTr_3D6SeR0Q7kNvwGv1Q7H&amp;_nc_oc=AdqoiQ_DP3zO96z76BPGpJ7xGuwQcncA1qyZyEPiCH_7KEK6gKftATejb2_bHA0KaL4&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=L73ksMJTJIBxGQf6Zyi6kA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLCnXuynnjjt4mWJmwRtyr0b2zgUr8GSk11T7qpCpTjPBZSs2BSp6xYXPMNTz8d93PMFjUQuTpR&amp;oh=00_AQMId74TRiUPL-xE_-yoMKyVmYYtX_MU26TItp2hK4P8Lw&amp;oe=6ADFA738\" width=\"960\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-ams2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854246055_1555400873274850_8856064918901545395_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=rkORYc1rkTsQ7kNvwH1tkEx&amp;_nc_oc=AdrJ3tl5TxuNDVPQAk9rV3YEtS-_93G92cVirajMUhPw9mXzJXhoX9DWdrsDbbcJvMc&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-